cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Field Shuffle in a project that generates a research output,
  please cite this software in addition to citing REDCap.

type: software

title: "Field Shuffle (REDCap External Module)"

abstract: >-
  Field Shuffle is a REDCap External Module for randomizing the display order
  of fields on REDCap survey pages, data entry forms, and native multi-page
  surveys. It stores the realized order in a designated text field, replays
  valid stored orders, and supports independent fields, fixed-order blocks,
  fixed page structures, one-unit-per-page randomization, internal subgroup
  shuffling, and page-header overrides.

